        'Acute: group and save, blood cultures, CXR, oxygen saturation, urinalysis, liver function',
        'Transcranial Doppler annually from age 2 to 16 for HbSS: velocity over 200 cm/s indicates high stroke risk',
        'MRI/MRA if neurological symptoms; echo in pulmonary hypertension',
